  "recordSet": [],
  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.1",
  "name": "melee-ranked-replays",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tMelee Ranked Replays\n\t\n\nAnonymized Slippi ranked replays (platinum+) from Super Smash Bros. Melee,\nsharded by character and rank pair. Built for behavior-cloning and other\nreplay-driven ML work on Melee \u2014 notably MIMIC.\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tContents\n\t\n\nRaw .slp files grouped into tarballs by (character, rank_pair, source_archive),\norganized into per-character folders:\n{CHAR}/\n  {CHAR}_{rank_pair}_a{N}.tar.gz\nmetadata/\n  metadata_a{N}.json\n\n\nCharacters (25): BOWSER, CPTFALCON, DK, DOC, FALCO\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/JoeyDonuts/melee-ranked-replays.",
  "alternateName": [
    "JoeyDonuts/melee-ranked-replays",
    "Melee Ranked Replays"
  ],
  "creator": {
    "@type": "Person",
    "name": "Joey Farah",
    "url": "https://huggingface.co/JoeyDonuts"
  },
  "keywords": [
    "reinforcement-learning",
    "other",
    "English",
    "mit",
    "100K<n<1M",
    "\ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8 Region: US",
    "super-smash-bros-melee",
    "slippi",
    "gamecube",
    "behavior-cloning",
    "replays"
  ],
  "license": "https://choosealicense.com/licenses/mit/",
